---
title: Simple Flowchart
layout: tree-down
---

# A basic login flow
start [circle] "Start"
login [rect] "Login Form"
check [decision] "Valid?"
dashboard [rect] "Dashboard"
error [rect] "Error" { backgroundColor: "#fecaca" }
end [circle] "End"

start -> login
login -> check
check -> dashboard "Yes"
check -> error "No"
error -> login "Retry"
dashboard -> end
